  "paragraph": 3,
  "text": "In this video, we are going to open up a modern agent harness from end to end. After drawing clean boundaries between models, harnesses, and frameworks, we will walk through four single-agent foundations: the core loop and tool calling, context management and caching, durable memory across sessions, and verification with sandboxing. Then we will level up into subagent delegation and cloud scale, and finish with observability, evals, and how to evolve a harness without drowning in dead code.",
